# from the tracked .java sources by the run recipe in Blake3SelfTest.java).
*.class

# IDE / tooling
.vs/
.vscode/
*.user
*.suo
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
cmake_install.cmake
Makefile

# Logs
*.log

# Local artifacts not for source control
# _download/ — cached downloads (ULAH zip etc.); regenerated by build/release scripts
# release-staging/ — generated drag-drop release; produced by release scripts
# test-install/ — local staging area used when iterating against the live game
_download/
release-staging/
test-install/

# Local-only working materials — kept on disk, never committed to the public
# repo. The agent governance system (.claude/ + CLAUDE.md), reverse-engineering
# toolchain (third-party-ghidra/), RE research scratch (_research/), internal
# planning + bug trails (docs/outstanding-work/, docs/known-issues/), and the
# pak-mod test fixtures (test-fixtures/) all live here locally.
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
_research/
third-party-ghidra/
test-fixtures/
docs/outstanding-work/
docs/known-issues/